<h2>杆侧与单据采信</h2><div class="tablebox"><table><thead><tr><th>原件</th><th>提交行</th><th>结构可读</th><th>重复表头</th><th>格式隔离</th><th>车牌隔离</th></tr></thead><tbody>{% for row in report.intake.sheets %}<tr><td>{{ row.source }}</td><td>{{ row.submitted }}</td><td>{{ row.parsed }}</td><td>{{ row.headers }}</td><td>{{ row.isolation|length }}</td><td>{{ row.bad_plates|length }}</td></tr>{% endfor %}</tbody></table></div>
<p>采信停测申报 {{ report.intake.outage_windows }} 条{% if report.intake.outage_issues %}，隔离 {{ report.intake.outage_issues|length }} 条{% endif %}{% if report.outages.berths %}；申报 {{ report.outages.outage_minutes }} 分钟中 {{ report.outages.pending_minutes }} 分钟待核{% endif %}。</p>
{% set ns=namespace(issues=report.intake.sensor_issues+report.intake.booking_issues+report.intake.outage_issues) %}{% for row in report.intake.sheets %}{% set ns.issues=ns.issues+row.isolation+row.bad_plates %}{% endfor %}{% set issues=ns.issues %}{% include 'issues.j2' %}
